 "text": "-->\nValley View Milling - Homepage\n-->\nHomepage\nToggle Navigation\nCASH BIDS\nWEATHER\nSIGN UP FOR ALERTS\nGROWER PORTAL\nHOME\nABOUT US\nHOURS & CONTACT INFO\nGRAINS\nGrain Services\nCorn Discount Schedule\nSoybean Discount Schedule\nFEED\nFeed Services\nFORMS\nAll Forms\nKansas Ag Exempt Certificate\nKansas Resale Exemption Certificate\nNebraska Tax Exempt Certificate\nMissouri Tax Exempt Certificate\nIowa Sales Tax Exemption Certificate\nColorado Tax Exempt Certificate\nCredit Application\nCredit Application Opt-Out\nMARKET DATA\nMarket Overview\nFutures\nOptions\nStandard Charts\nTechnical Charts\nSpread Charts\nNEWS\nAg Market Commentary\nAgWeb\nUSDA Reports\nJOBS\nJob Openings\nVVM Application\nVVT Application\nONLINE PAYMENT\nLogin\nLOGIN\nLogin\nMy Account\n-->\nValley View Milling\n2875 KS-63\nSeneca, KS 66538\nCall our Grain Buying Phone Number!\n(785) 294-3857\nAccess Grower Portal\nPrevious\nNext\n-->\nGrain\n|\nFeed\n|\nTrucking\n|\nWelcome to Valley View Milling, LLC\nThe Warehouse and Office will be closed on Friday, July 3rd and Saturday, July 4th.\nPlease pay attention to all posted signs and guidelines.\nCheck out our Discount Schedules and Delay Payment policies.\nSoybeans\nCorn\nCall our Grain Buying Phone Number to sell your grain,\n(785) 294-3857\nOr call our main office to talk about your feed & grain needs.\n(785) 336-5355\nThank you!\nHarvest Hours:\nMonday-Friday: 7:00 a.m. - 5:00 p.m.\nSaturday: 7:00 a.m. - 12:00 p.m.\nSunday : CLOSED\nNormal Hours :\nMonday-Friday 5:00 a.m. - 5:00 p.m.\nSaturday 7:00 a.m. - 11:00 a.m.\nCall us at (785) 336-5355 to find out what we can do for you!\n2875 KS-63\nSeneca, KS 66538\nFutures Quotes\nName | Month | Last | Change |\nCorn | Dec 26 | 474-2s | -3-6 |\nCorn | Mar 27 | 486-4s | -4-4 |\nCorn | May 27 | 493-4s | -4-4 |\nCorn | Jul 27 | 499-2s | -4-2 |\nCorn | Sep 27 | 494-0s | -3-4 |\n|\nSoybean | Nov 26 | 1261-2s | -1-6 |\nSoybean | Jan 27 | 1275-6s | -2-0 |\nSoybean | Mar 27 | 1284-2s | -